s from China that - and then China reciprocates by putting tariffs on the stuff in from the U.S. I talked to my friend, Steven Mnuchin when I was at The White House for the signing of the China trade agreement.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LVS 2019 Q4","e":"lvs","d":"2020-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sheldon Adelson","x":"And he says that they're moving forward, probably moving forward faster than what the people would expect for Phase 2 of the resolution of the so-called trade war.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LVS 2020 Q2","e":"lvs","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dumont","x":"And so when you think about our controllable operating expenses, we have taken cost out of the business, but the margin structure you should expect is going to be related to the mix of business more than it is on the incremental costs we've taken out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LVS 2022 Q1","e":"lvs","d":"2022-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dumont","x":"And I think that's really the nature of our business that we have pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LVS 2022 Q4","e":"lvs","d":"2023-01-27","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Rob Goldstein","x":"…to build a casino, looking to build not a regional casino but rather a truly large hotel with spa convention space, dozens of restaurants, a new theater, a huge entertainment feature, a transformational product, which will positively impact the community and grow tourism a powerful statement.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LVS 2022 Q4","e":"lvs","d":"2023-01-27","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Rob Goldstein","x":"Our theaters, our retail, our entertainment has driven billions and billions and billions of dollars